{"seq":2,"slug":"time-observability-monitoring-slo","title":"时间可观测性：chrony/PTP 指标、时钟偏差告警、SLO 与混沌测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/time-synchronization-ntp-ptp-chrony-engineering/cloud-monitoring-leap-distributed-correctness/time-observability-monitoring-slo","wordCount":2633,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"时间可观测性-chrony-ptp-指标-时钟偏差告警-slo-与混沌测试\">时间可观测性：chrony/PTP 指标、时钟偏差告警、SLO 与混沌测试</h1><p>一台时钟同步正常的机器不产生任何日志——<code>chronyd</code> 安静地每 64 秒发一次 poll，偏移在微秒级抖动。正因为「正常」是静默的，时间故障在爆发前往往已潜伏数周：振荡器老化导致频偏缓慢漂移、上游源悄悄从 stratum 2 掉到 stratum 4、VM 被迁移到负载更重的宿主机。时间可观测性就是把这条静默的基线变成可度量的曲线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从静默的正常到可度量的偏差\">核心概念：从静默的正常到可度量的偏差</h2><p>时间监控与传统服务监控的根本差异在于：大多数故障模式不产生错误日志，而是<strong>静默的错误结果</strong>——日志时间戳排序错乱、租约提前过期、分布式事务因果颠倒。因此可观测性建立在三类量之上：<strong>偏移（offset）</strong>，本地时钟与参考的瞬时差；<strong>频偏（frequency）</strong>，本地晶振的速率误差及修正量；<strong>误差上界（dispersion）</strong>，同步链路不确定度的保守估计。前者告诉你「此刻差多少」，后两者告诉你「接下来会怎样」和「这个数字有多可信」。</p>\n<p>chrony 提供机器可读出口 <code>chronyc tracking</code> 与 <code>chronyc sourcestats</code>；<code>chrony_exporter</code> 把它们转成指标，<code>node_exporter</code> 通过 <code>--collector.timex</code> 暴露内核 PLL 层的 <code>node_timex_offset_seconds</code>、<code>node_timex_estimated_error_seconds</code> 与 <code>node_timex_sync_status</code>：前者反映内核如何驯服时钟，后者反映 daemon 对源的判断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标（典型命名）</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>失效信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>chrony_tracking_offset_seconds</code></td>\n<td>系统时钟相对所选参考的偏移</td>\n<td>突跳 → 上游源异常或时钟被拉偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chrony_tracking_frequency_ppm</code></td>\n<td>施加的频偏修正（ppm）</td>\n<td>单调增大 → 晶振老化或温度漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chrony_tracking_skew_ppm</code></td>\n<td>频偏估计的不确定度</td>\n<td>持续增大 → 源质量下降或网络抖动加剧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chrony_tracking_root_delay_seconds</code></td>\n<td>到 stratum-1 的累计往返延迟</td>\n<td>突增 → 上游链路劣化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chrony_tracking_root_dispersion_seconds</code></td>\n<td>到 stratum-1 的累计离散度（误差上界）</td>\n<td>最值得告警的一个量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chrony_tracking_stratum</code> / <code>_leap_status</code></td>\n<td>本地时钟层级 / leap 状态</td>\n<td>掉层或非 Normal → 源不可达或闰秒将至</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>node_timex_estimated_error_seconds</code></td>\n<td>内核估计的当前最大误差</td>\n<td>超业务容差 → 分布式正确性风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chrony_sources_reach</code> / <code>_state</code></td>\n<td>每源可达位图 / 状态（<code>*</code> 同步、<code>+</code> 候选、<code>-</code> 排除）</td>\n<td>reach=0 或无非排除源 → 失去同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>root dispersion 是最被低估的指标。</strong> 偏移量是「此刻看起来差多少」，root dispersion 是「我到 stratum-1 这条链路上误差上界有多宽」——它随时间累积、反映源质量。一台 offset 只有 5μs 但 root dispersion 达到 50ms 的机器实际上已不可信：它同步的那个参考自己都不知道离真实 UTC 有多远。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[chronyd daemon] --&gt;|chronyc tracking/sourcestats| B[chrony_exporter]&#10;    C[Linux kernel PLL] --&gt;|timex syscall| D[node_exporter timex]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Prometheus scrape]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[Recording rules 计算 d_offset/dt]&#10;    E --&gt; G[Alerting rules 阈值 + rate + for 时长]&#10;    E --&gt; H[Grafana 偏移/频偏/离散度三联图]&#10;    G --&gt; I[PagerDuty On-call]&#10;    B --&gt; J[chrony_sources_state 逐源健康]&#10;    J --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[chronyd daemon] --&gt;|chronyc tracking/sourcestats| B[chrony_exporter]\n    C[Linux kernel PLL] --&gt;|timex syscall| D[node_exporter timex]\n    B --&gt; E[Prometheus scrape]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[Recording rules 计算 d_offset/dt]\n    E --&gt; G[Alerting rules 阈值 + rate + for 时长]\n    E --&gt; H[Grafana 偏移/频偏/离散度三联图]\n    G --&gt; I[PagerDuty On-call]\n    B --&gt; J[chrony_sources_state 逐源健康]\n    J --&gt; G</pre><p>抓取频率要和 chrony 的更新节奏对齐：chrony 默认对每个源每 64 秒轮询一次，offset 只在一次测量后才变化。若 Prometheus 每 15 秒抓而指标 60 秒才变，会得到大量重复样本，让 <code>rate()</code> / <code>deriv()</code> 算出阶梯状假斜率——给时间指标单独设 30–60 秒 scrape interval 更务实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值不是猜的-用误差预算推导时钟偏差告警线\">阈值不是猜的：用误差预算推导时钟偏差告警线</h2><p>「偏移超过多少算异常」应由下游对时间的容差反推。对任何分布式因果判断，重要的不是绝对精度，而是<strong>同一次事件在两条链路上被判定的时间差是否安全</strong>。若机器 A、B 相对真实 UTC 各有误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其相对误差上界是保守估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_{AB} \\le e_A + e_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而单机误差上界可由 root dispersion 直接读取。可观测量到业务安全线的映射是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>danger</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>safe</mtext></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{danger}} = \\frac{\\Delta_{\\text{safe}}}{2} - m_{\\text{overhead}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">danger</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2392em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8942em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">safe</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>safe</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{safe}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">safe</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是业务能容忍的相对时序偏差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{overhead}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是采集与呈现链路自身的抖动余量——这个公式把「告警阈值」变成从真实业务约束推导出的数。分级告警是必要的，阈值只告诉你不安全，不告诉你多紧急：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>判据（示例，需按误差预算裁剪）</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>warning</td>\n<td>offset &gt; 10ms 持续 5m，或 reach != 255</td>\n<td>精度退化，未破坏正确性</td>\n<td>进工单，查网络与源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>critical</td>\n<td>offset &gt; 100ms 持续 2m，或 stratum 掉层</td>\n<td>可能导致因果错序</td>\n<td>立刻 on-call</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>page</td>\n<td><code>node_timex_sync_status == 0</code> 持续 1m</td>\n<td>内核判定未同步</td>\n<td>全链路排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静默</td>\n<td><code>chrony_sources_state</code> 中无 <code>*</code> 源</td>\n<td>已失去主参考</td>\n<td>与 page 同级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong><code>for</code> 时长是最容易做错的一环。</strong> chrony 做阶跃修正（step）时 offset 瞬间归零、做 slew 时平滑收敛，短暂超阈值是正常收敛过程。没有 <code>for: 5m</code> 缓冲，每次源切换都误报，运维很快把告警静音——系统实际处于无监控状态；<code>for</code> 设成 30 分钟又会漏掉快速劣化。另一类必须显式告警的独立事件是<strong>步进本身</strong>：一次意外的 step 意味着本地时间被瞬间改写——单调时钟不受影响，但 <code>CLOCK_REALTIME</code> 会跳变，基于墙钟的定时、租约、TTL 都可能出错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"slo-把-时间质量-变成可承诺-可结算的指标\">SLO：把「时间质量」变成可承诺、可结算的指标</h2><p>精度指标是瞬时的，SLO 是累积的。时间 SLO 度量<strong>处于误差预算内的时间占比</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SLI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>窗口内 </mtext><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>est</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>budget</mtext></msub><mtext> 的采样数</mtext></mrow><mtext>窗口内总采样数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SLI} = \\frac{\\text{窗口内 } e_{\\text{est}}(t) \\le e_{\\text{budget}} \\text{ 的采样数}}{\\text{窗口内总采样数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3831em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0381em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">窗口内总采样数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5131em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">窗口内</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">est</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">budget</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">的采样数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，典型 SLO 取 99.9%，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>est</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_{\\text{est}}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">est</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 可取自 <code>node_timex_estimated_error_seconds</code> 或 <code>chrony_tracking_root_dispersion_seconds</code>。这个定义不依赖单一瞬时值：一次 30 秒抖动若不落在关键窗口就不消耗预算；持续 10 分钟的小幅劣化则会稳定吃掉预算，逼出容量决策。误差预算可做成燃尽（error budget）形态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预算消耗</th>\n<th>触发动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 50%</td>\n<td>正常，常规容量观察</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50%–75%</td>\n<td>评估是否增加/升级时间源，记录趋势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>75%–100%</td>\n<td>冻结会改变宿主机负载或网络路径的变更，优先排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超支</td>\n<td>触发时间基础设施专项，暂停非紧急部署</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SLO 必须和<strong>分层服务范畴</strong>绑定：金融撮合、分布式共识集群可能要求亚毫秒级且 SLO 99.99%，普通日志采集节点 10ms 量级、SLO 99% 就足够；把 1000 台不同用途的机器混成一个总 SLI，会掩盖关键少数机器的严重问题。另一个落地陷阱是**「沉默即合规」**：exporter 挂掉、scrape 失败时 Prometheus 停止产生样本，若 SLI 分母也只统计成功抓取，一次宕机反而让该机器从统计里消失、SLI 变好看。修法是用显式 <code>up{job=&quot;chrony&quot;}</code> 心跳，把「抓取失败」算作不合规采样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混沌测试-主动证伪时钟假设-而不是等它自己崩\">混沌测试：主动证伪时钟假设，而不是等它自己崩</h2><p>与其等生产环境偶然暴露问题，不如在设计好的实验里主动制造时钟异常，把可观测性从被动监控推向主动验证。可复现实验按侵入性递增：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实验</th>\n<th>手法</th>\n<th>验证的假设</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冻结时钟</td>\n<td><code>kill -STOP &lt;pid&gt;</code> 后恢复</td>\n<td>进程是否正确处理单调时钟暂停语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大幅偏移</td>\n<td><code>chronyd makestep</code> 或 <code>date -s</code>，偏移 10s–1h</td>\n<td>租约、TTL、证书校验是否崩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频偏注入</td>\n<td>改写 guest TSC / <code>libfaketime</code></td>\n<td>依赖 <code>CLOCK_MONOTONIC</code> 的定时器漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闰秒模拟</td>\n<td>测试域注入 23:59:60</td>\n<td>时间解析、序列化、POSIX 秒计数是否溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>源不可达</td>\n<td>阻断 NTP/PTP 端口 123/319/320</td>\n<td>本地自主运行能力（holdover）与恢复行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>源欺骗</td>\n<td>伪造大偏移响应（NTS 关闭时）</td>\n<td>时钟被拉走的幅度与恢复时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[定义时钟正确性假设] --&gt; B[设计最小混沌实验]&#10;    B --&gt; C[在隔离测试域执行]&#10;    C --&gt; D{表现符合预期?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[记录 假设成立]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{系统缺陷还是监控缺陷?}&#10;    F --&gt;|系统缺陷| G[修复 补测试用例]&#10;    F --&gt;|监控缺陷| H[补指标或告警规则]&#10;    G --&gt; I[回归 重复验证]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[定义时钟正确性假设] --&gt; B[设计最小混沌实验]\n    B --&gt; C[在隔离测试域执行]\n    C --&gt; D{表现符合预期?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[记录 假设成立]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{系统缺陷还是监控缺陷?}\n    F --&gt;|系统缺陷| G[修复 补测试用例]\n    F --&gt;|监控缺陷| H[补指标或告警规则]\n    G --&gt; I[回归 重复验证]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; A</pre><p>三个实操要点：<strong>在隔离域里做</strong>——时钟被拉偏可能触发证书吊销、分布式锁失效、数据库主从切换，破坏半径远超单机；<strong>先建立基线再注入</strong>——没有正常态偏移曲线作对照，无法判断注入后的变化是故障还是本就存在的抖动；<strong>闰秒实验固定版本</strong>——不同内核、glibc、运行时对 23:59:60 的处理各不相同（IERS 公报是权威来源，国际计量界已决定 2035 年前取消闰秒）。混沌测试与监控形成闭环：每个实验都应对应一条能在真实故障中触发的告警；若某实验失败却没有告警响过，说明监控规则有缺口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从单体到分布式-横向扩展与协作\">从单体到分布式：横向扩展与协作</h2><p>规模上升到数千节点后，逐机翻 <code>chronyc tracking</code> 不再可行，可观测性链条需要三点改造：<strong>聚合而非孤立</strong>（用 recording rules 预计算每个机房、故障域的偏移 P50/P99 与不合规比例，把判定从单机抬升到域）、<strong>分层采样</strong>（对大部分节点降频到 60 秒，只对关键节点保持高频）、<strong>跨源关联</strong>（时间异常往往伴随网络丢包与宿主机 CPU steal/中断延迟同步变化，放进同一张面板能快速定位是网络、宿主机还是源本身）。</p>\n<p>联动分布式正确性层是最终目的。现代分布式系统多数不依赖墙钟做因果判断——Spanner 用 TrueTime 的置信区间（Google 2012 OSDI 论文《Spanner: Google&#39;s Globally-Distributed Database》），各实现用混合逻辑时钟（HLC）把物理时间与逻辑计数结合，让「误差上界」而非「绝对精度」成为关键参数。因此关注点不是 offset 越小越好，而是<strong>误差上界与置信区间是否被保守估计并对外暴露</strong>。</p>\n<p>源管理细节见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../ntp-protocol-chrony-operations/chrony-deployment-configuration\">chrony 部署与配置</a>；硬件时间戳如何决定可达精度见 <a href=\"../ptp-ieee1588-high-precision/ptp-hardware-timestamping-transparent-clock\">PTP 硬件时间戳与透明时钟</a>；误差预算定义见 <a href=\"../clock-hardware-timescale-foundations/clock-offset-skew-error-budget\">时钟偏移、频偏与误差预算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>时间可观测性把「正常是静默的」转化为可度量、可告警、可承诺、可证伪的工程实践：<strong>指标</strong>从 chrony exporter 与内核 timex 两条口径采集，其中 root dispersion 是最被低估的可信度信号；<strong>阈值</strong>用误差预算与业务容差反推，谨慎设置 <code>for</code> 时长以避免告警疲劳；<strong>SLO</strong> 把处于误差预算内的时间占比变成可结算的燃尽指标，并警惕「沉默即合规」陷阱；<strong>混沌测试</strong>主动注入冻结、偏移、闰秒、源欺骗等故障，与告警形成闭环。最终目标不是让 offset 尽可能小，而是让误差上界被保守估计、被观测、被验证。</p>\n<p><strong>可核验来源</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>chrony 文档（<code>chronyc tracking</code> / <code>sourcestats</code> 字段与 <code>makestep</code> 行为）：<a href=\"https://chrony.tuxfamily.org/documentation.html\">https://chrony.tuxfamily.org/documentation.html</a></li>\n<li><code>chrony_exporter</code> <a href=\"https://github.com/superq/chrony_exporter\">https://github.com/superq/chrony_exporter</a> ｜ <code>node_exporter</code> timex collector <a href=\"https://github.com/prometheus/node_exporter\">https://github.com/prometheus/node_exporter</a></li>\n<li>RFC 5905（NTPv4）｜RFC 8633（NTP 安全）｜RFC 8915（NTS）：<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5905\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5905</a></li>\n<li>IEEE 1588-2019（PTPv2.1）：<a href=\"https://standards.ieee.org/ieee/1588/6825/\">https://standards.ieee.org/ieee/1588/6825/</a></li>\n<li>TrueTime：Corbett et al., <em>Spanner</em>, OSDI 2012，<a href=\"https://research.google/pubs/pub39966/\">https://research.google/pubs/pub39966/</a> ｜ IERS 闰秒：<a href=\"https://www.iers.org/IERS/EN/Science/EarthRotation/LeapSecond.html\">https://www.iers.org/IERS/EN/Science/EarthRotation/LeapSecond.html</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时间可观测性：chrony/PTP 指标、时钟偏差告警、SLO 与混沌测试","id":"时间可观测性-chrony-ptp-指标-时钟偏差告警-slo-与混沌测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从静默的正常到可度量的偏差","id":"核心概念-从静默的正常到可度量的偏差"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值不是猜的：用误差预算推导时钟偏差告警线","id":"阈值不是猜的-用误差预算推导时钟偏差告警线"},{"level":2,"text":"SLO：把「时间质量」变成可承诺、可结算的指标","id":"slo-把-时间质量-变成可承诺-可结算的指标"},{"level":2,"text":"混沌测试：主动证伪时钟假设，而不是等它自己崩","id":"混沌测试-主动证伪时钟假设-而不是等它自己崩"},{"level":2,"text":"从单体到分布式：横向扩展与协作","id":"从单体到分布式-横向扩展与协作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"云时钟源架构：厂商 NTP/PTP 托管服务、多源冗余与区域时钟策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/time-synchronization-ntp-ptp-chrony-engineering/cloud-monitoring-leap-distributed-correctness/cloud-time-source-architecture"},"next":{"title":"分布式系统时间正确性：漂移与因果、TrueTime/HLC、事件排序与日志时间戳","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/time-synchronization-ntp-ptp-chrony-engineering/cloud-monitoring-leap-distributed-correctness/distributed-time-correctness-truetime"}}